Baize is a powerful and exquisite WSGI/ASGI framework/toolkit.
Under the ASGI/WSGI protocol, the interface of the request
object and the response object is almost the same, only need
to add or delete await in the appropriate place. In addition,
it should be noted that ASGI supports WebSocket but WSGI does not.
- Type annotations as strict as possible (almost no Any)
- Support range file response, server-sent event response
- Support WebSocket (only ASGI)
- WSGI, ASGI routing to combine any application like Django(wsgi),
  Kuí(wsgi), Pyramid, Bottle, Flask or Django(asgi), Kuí(asgi),
  Starlette, FastAPI, Sanic, Quart
